## Epic 3: Open the account

### US-06: Create customer and account automatically
**As a** branch operations manager, **I want** accounts created automatically in the core banking system, **so that** nobody has to re-type customer data.
**Requirement:** FR-09 | **Priority:** Must | **Points:** 8

**Acceptance criteria**
- **Given** an application has passed or been approved, **when** the account creation step runs, **then** the customer and account are created through the core-banking API.
- **Given** the API call fails, **when** the error is returned, **then** the request is retried up to 3 times and then raised to operations with the application ID.
- **Given** an account is created, **when** the process completes, **then** the account number is stored against the application record.
- **Given** the same application is submitted twice, **when** the second request arrives, **then** no duplicate customer or account is created.

### US-07: Review and sign the agreement
**As a** new customer, **I want to** review and sign my account agreement electronically, **so that** I can open my account without paperwork.
**Requirement:** FR-10 | **Priority:** Must | **Points:** 5

**Acceptance criteria**
- **Given** my account is ready, **when** I reach the final step, **then** I see a summary of account type, fees and card details.
- **Given** I have not ticked the agreement box, **when** I tap "Sign and open account", **then** the button is disabled.
- **Given** I sign, **when** the signature is saved, **then** a PDF copy is stored and available for download.
- **Given** I have not signed, **when** I check my account, **then** it is not active (BR-05).

### US-08: Get confirmation and a virtual card
**As a** new customer, **I want** instant confirmation and a virtual card, **so that** I can start using my account right away.
**Requirement:** FR-11, FR-12 | **Priority:** Must / Should | **Points:** 5

**Acceptance criteria**
- **Given** my account is activated, **when** the process completes, **then** I receive an SMS and an email with my account details (account number partly masked).
- **Given** I open the app, **when** my account is active, **then** my virtual card is visible and can be added to a mobile wallet.
- **Given** the SMS or email fails to send, **when** the failure is detected, **then** the app shows the confirmation on screen instead.

