## Definition of Ready
- Story has an owner, clear value statement and acceptance criteria
- Dependencies identified; estimable by the team
- Wireframe or design available where relevant

## Definition of Done
- Acceptance criteria met and tested
- Code reviewed; automated tests pass
- Security and POPIA checks complete for stories handling personal data
- Product Owner has accepted the story in sprint review
